INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('AMAGI', 'Amagi Media Labs Limited (AMAGI) is a company operating in the Technology sector (Software - Application). Amagi Media Labs Limited operates as a software-as-a-service company that connects media companies to their audiences through cloud-native technology in India, the United States, Europe, the Asia Pacific, and the Middle East. The company offers Cloud Modernization products, such as Amagi STUDIO, a cloud-based live video production suite that allows media teams to create and produce live shows, sports events, and news coverage using a browser; Amagi CLOUDPORT, a cloud-based broadcast operations platform that allows television networks and content owners to replace hardware-intensive playout systems with software-defined environment; Amagi CLIP, a Short-form video creation platform; Amagi DYNAMIC that enables Amagi CLOUDPORT to manage one-off live events; and managed services. It also provides streaming unification products, including Media Management; VOD Distribution; Amagi THUNDERSTORM, an ad insertion platform; Smart Scheduler, an AI-powered scheduling platform; Amagi CONNECT, a content distribution and syndication marketplace; FAST Distribution; Amagi PLANNER; Amagi ADS PLUS, a CTV advertising marketplace; and Amagi ANALYTICS, a streaming analytics platform that provides actionable viewership and advertising performance insights. In addition, the company offers monetization products comprising server-side ad insertion and ad marketplace. Further, it provides Amagi NOW Platform, an agentic industry cloud platform that enables media organizations to modernize and monetize content, including through the deployment of artificial intelligence-enabled solutions. The company was incorporated in 2008 and is headquartered in Bengaluru, India.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Software - Application within the Technology industry.', 'Provides products and services in Software - Application within the Technology industry.', 'Technology; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Technology sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Technology.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('AMANTA', 'Amanta Healthcare Limited (AMANTA) is a company operating in the Healthcare sector (Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic). Amanta Healthcare Limited operates as a pharmaceutical company engaged in developing, manufacturing and marketing a diverse range of sterile liquid products and parenteral products in Africa, Latin America, the United Kingdom, and internationally. The company manufactures its products in three product group segments Large Volume Parenteral, Nipple Head (Single Port), SteriPort (Two Ports), and Small Volume Parenteral. Additionally, it manufactures medical devices and fluid therapy - (IV Fluid), formulations, diluents, ophthalmic, respiratory care and irrigation solutions in therapeutic segment and products, such as irrigation, first-aid solution, and eye lubricants in medical device segment. It also offers a wide range of closure systems, such as nipple head, twist-off, and screw types and container fill-volume ranging from 2ml to 1000 ml. Its markets its products through three strategic business units including national sales, international sales, and product partnering with various foreign and Indian pharmaceutical companies. Amanta Healthcare Limited was formerly known as Marck Biosciences Limited and changed its name to Amanta Healthcare Limited in June 2014. Amanta Healthcare Limited was incorporated in 1994 and is headquartered in Ahmedabad, India.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic within the Healthcare industry.', 'Provides products and services in Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic within the Healthcare industry.', 'Healthcare; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Healthcare sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Healthcare.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
