INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('AUBANK', 'AU Small Finance Bank Limited (AUBANK) is a company operating in the Financial Services sector (Banks - Regional). AU Small Finance Bank Limited provides various banking and financial services in India. The company operates through Treasury, Retail Banking, Wholesale Banking, and Other Banking Operations segments. It offers savings, NRI, corporate salary, senior citizen, women and family, minor, current, premium banking, special offerings, RERA and escrow, collection, share capital and dividend, EXIM, institution current, government banking, Forex, SNRR, and grouping of business and personal accounts; and fixed, recurring, FCNR, and green fixed deposits. The company also provides home, car, commercial vehicle and equipment, gold, personal, two-wheeler, tractor, micro business, working capital, term, commercial vehicle, and tractor loans; loan secured by vehicle, and against FD and property; supply chain finance, renewables funding, real estate funding and project finance, and NBFC and startup funding; and trade finance, such as letter of credit, bank guarantees, buyer''s credit, export credit, and Forex and hedging solutions. In addition, it offers cards and payments, including debit and credit cards, ATM and micro-ATM, UPI/Scan and Pay, fund transfer, doorstep banking, international payments, bill pay, mobile recharge, FASTag, and tax payments; AU 0101 and AU 0101 Business applications; and wealth products comprising mutual funds, ASBA/IPO, PMS/AIF/Bonds, and 3-in-1 trading and demat accounts. Further, the company provides life, health, and general insurance; and locker products. It serves urban, semi-urban, and rural markets, as well as salaried and self-employed individuals, small businesses, merchants, women entrepreneurs, farmers, micro-enterprises, and emerging affluent households. The company was formerly known as AU Financiers (India) Limited and changed its name to AU Small Finance Bank Limited in May 2017. AU Small Finance Bank Limited was incorporated in 1996 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Banks - Regional within the Financial Services industry.', 'Provides products and services in Banks - Regional within the Financial Services industry.', 'Financial Services; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Financial Services sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Financial Services.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('AUGMONT', 'AUGMONT ENTERPRISES LTD (AUGMONT) is a company operating in the Consumer Cyclical sector (Luxury Goods). Augmont Enterprises Limited operates as an integrated gold and silver platform in India. It engages in procurement and refining, bullion trading, digital gold offerings, jewellery manufacturing, international sales and facilitating gold-backed financial services. The company operates its enterprise sales vertical through its Augmont SPOT'' platform, a fully electronic, over-the-counter delivery-based bullion platform that enables such as jewelers, bullion dealers, and manufacturers with valid GST registrations to purchase gold and silver bars online. It is also involved in the sale of gold bullion to asset management companies in exchange for units of gold exchange traded funds (ETF) and trade in gold and silver ETF units. In addition, the company manufactures and sells gold jewelry articles, which include chains to jewelry traders, as well as platinum. Further, it serves consumers through its Augmont Gold For All'' platform by offering access to a range of gold and silver related services. The company''s platform enables users to buy, sell, and store gold and silver digitally; purchase gold through systematic investment plans; liquidate and sell old gold; purchase coins starting from 1 gm; and avail technology support for gold loans. Augmont Enterprises Limited was founded in 1994 and is based in Mumbai, India.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Luxury Goods within the Consumer Cyclical industry.', 'Provides products and services in Luxury Goods within the Consumer Cyclical industry.', 'Consumer Cyclical; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Consumer Cyclical sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Consumer Cyclical.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('AURIONPRO', 'Aurionpro Solutions Limited (AURIONPRO) is a company operating in the Technology sector (Software - Application). Aurionpro Solutions Limited provides technology solutions in India, Asia-Pacific, and internationally. It operates through Sale of Software Services, and Sale of Equipment and Product License segments. The company offers Arya.ai, an enterprise solutions specializing in banking and financial services; and Lexi.ai to deliver accurate, true-to-model explainability, monitoring, risk management, and alignment techniques, as well as operates lexi.ai AI alignment labs. It also provides Murex Services, a managed services provide specialized capital markets solutions; Fenixys for delivering complex front-to-back transformations; FX Connect provides retail and corporate services; iCashpro a next-generation transaction banking platform; Fintra for trade & supply chain; AuroDigi, a digital banking platform for wholesale banking services; and Aurobees, an integrated supply chain and financing platforms. In addition, the company offers data center solutions and services, such as engineering, construction, products and solutions, and various support services; hybrid cloud services, including devops automation, cloud and hosting, managed cloud, monitoring, network security, server management, and helpdesk services; and integro corporate lending solutions, comprising loan origination system, financial analysis, limits management system, collateral management system, trade limit, early warning system, and document management system, smaert rules, view, capture, collect, data connect, connect risk analytics, intelligence, ESG and digital form; and consumer lending solution. Further, it offers G to G Solutions, E-governance public, and smart city services. Aurionpro Solutions Limited was incorporated in 1997 and is headquartered in Navi Mumbai, India.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Software - Application within the Technology industry.', 'Provides products and services in Software - Application within the Technology industry.', 'Technology; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Technology sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Technology.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('AUROPHARMA', 'Aurobindo Pharma Limited (AUROPHARMA) is a company operating in the Healthcare sector (Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic). Aurobindo Pharma Limited, a pharmaceutical company, develops, manufactures, and commercializes generic pharmaceuticals in India, the United States, Europe, and internationally. The company manufactures a range of finished formulation products in various forms, such as oral solids, liquids, injectables for generic pharmaceuticals, branded specialty pharmaceuticals, and active pharmaceutical ingredients for CNS, anti-retroviral, cardiovascular, antibiotics, gastroenterology, anti-diabetics, and anti-allergic therapeutic areas. It also provides ointments, creams, gels, powders, transdermal, and lotions; antiretroviral drugs for PLHIV & CLHIV; and injectable products, including Penems, Penicillin, Cephalosporin, ophthalmic, inhalation, oncology, and hormone products. The company was incorporated in 1986 and is headquartered in Hyderabad, India.

