Products & Services: Provides products and services in Coking Coal within the Basic Materials industry.', 'Provides products and services in Coking Coal within the Basic Materials industry.', 'Basic Materials; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Basic Materials sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Basic Materials.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('BHARATFORG', 'Bharat Forge Limited (BHARATFORG) is a company operating in the Industrials sector (Metal Fabrication). Bharat Forge Limited engages in the manufacture and sale of forged and machined components in India and internationally. It operates through three segments: Forgings, Defence, and Others. The company offers automotive components comprising crankshafts, connecting rods, emission/after treatment, and fuel injection systems; chassis, such as front axle beams, steering knuckles, control arms, knuckle, forks, and reinforcement brackets; transmission and driveline components; and power generation components for thermal, hydro, and wind energy. It provides oil and gas forging products, such as subsea, surface, and drilling components; rail products, including engine and bogie components, turbochargers, and power electronics; and marine products that include propellers, marine motor, stern tube, crankshaft, conrod, piston rod, stock, trunk, and pintle. In addition, the company offers various components, such as turbochargers and superchargers, rotor assembly, and air cycle machine for land, marine, and aviation application; construction and mining products, including machined crankshafts, injector bodies, front spindles, and track links; and e-mobility, castings, and defense products. Further, it provides aerostructures, landing gear, and critical engine components. The company was incorporated in 1961 and is headquartered in Pune, India.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Metal Fabrication within the Industrials industry.', 'Provides products and services in Metal Fabrication within the Industrials industry.', 'Industrials; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Industrials sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Industrials.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('BHARATGEAR', 'Bharat Gears Limited (BHARATGEAR) is a company operating in the Consumer Cyclical sector (Auto Parts). Bharat Gears Limited manufactures and supplies automotive gear in India, the United States, Mexico, Spain, and internationally. The company provides gear products, such as ring gears, pinions, transmission gears, shafts, differential gears, and bevel gears; automotive components, including automotive clutch assemblies and components, turbochargers and related parts, driveline products, axle shafts, flywheel assemblies and rings, propeller shaft components, U-J Cross, steering components, differential cages, steel wheel rims, turbocharger core and rotor, ST. Bevel, ceramic button, and break lining; heat-treating furnaces; and precision machined components, shafts, fasteners, gears, castings, and forgings. It also offers single/multi-row pusher carburisng furnaces, rotary hearth furnaces, other heat-treating equipment and systems, and capabilities; and other heat-treating equipment and systems, such as conveyor mesh belt furnace lines, rotary retort furnaces, pusher furnaces for general applications, automation and handling systems, atmosphere systems, endothermic gas generators, and process control/ SCADA systems. The company serves original equipment manufacturers, as well as the automotive, agriculture, construction, utilities, and EV segments. Bharat Gears Limited was incorporated in 1971 and is based in Mumbai, India.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Auto Parts within the Consumer Cyclical industry.', 'Provides products and services in Auto Parts within the Consumer Cyclical industry.', 'Consumer Cyclical; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Consumer Cyclical sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Consumer Cyclical.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
