INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('BIOCON', 'Biocon Limited (BIOCON) is a company operating in the Healthcare sector (Biotechnology). Biocon Limited, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures biotechnology products and offers research services in India, the United States, Ireland, rest of the European Union, and internationally. It operates through Generics; Biosimilars; and Contract Research, Development and Manufacturing Organization (CRDMO) segments. The company offers generic formulations and API products, including cardiovascular, anti-diabetics, obesity, central nervous system, anti-cancer/oncology, multiple sclerosis, immunosuppressants, and specialty molecules; and biosimilars products for oncology, diabetes, and immunology therapeutic areas. It also provides integrated discovery, development, and manufacturing services to pharmaceutical, biotechnology, animal health, consumer goods, and specialty chemical industries, as well as academic institutions, non-profit organizations, and government agencies. In addition, the company offers enzyme, biopharmaceutical, and medicinal goods; contract research and manufacturing services; clinical research; and business support and development, and marketing services. Biocon Limited was incorporated in 1978 and is headquartered in Bengaluru, India.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Biotechnology within the Healthcare industry.', 'Provides products and services in Biotechnology within the Healthcare industry.', 'Healthcare; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Healthcare sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Healthcare.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('BIOFILCHEM', 'Biofil Chemicals and Pharmaceuticals Limited (BIOFILCHEM) is a company operating in the Healthcare sector (Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic). Biofil Chemicals and Pharmaceuticals Limited engages in the manufacturing and trading of pharmaceutical products in India. It operates through Pharma and Chemical segments. The company offers basic drugs and chemicals, including sodium chloride, potassium chloride, sodium citrate, diethyl carbamazine citrate, ferrous sulphate, dried ferrous sulphate, ferrus fumerate, micro crystalline cellulose, and dicyclomine hydrochloride. It also provides ferrous sulphate in crystal, exsiccated, and granular form; microcrystalline cellulose powder; cellulose powder; calcium carbonate; and sodium chloride. In addition, the company offers job work facility for manufacturing of pharmaceuticals drug. Biofil Chemicals and Pharmaceuticals Limited was founded in 1985 and is based in Indore, India

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic within the Healthcare industry.', 'Provides products and services in Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic within the Healthcare industry.', 'Healthcare; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Healthcare sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Healthcare.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('BIRLACABLE', 'Birla Cable Limited (BIRLACABLE) is a company operating in the Technology sector (Communication Equipment). Birla Cable Limited engages in the manufacture and sale of cables in India and internationally. The company offers wires and cables, lighting poles, solar energy systems and components trading, and fiber optic products and requisites trading.It also provides structured cable accessories, including patch cords, keystones, patch panels, faceplates, and connectors; telecom fibre accessories, such as adapter, pigtail, patch cord, fibre management, and joint closure; and fibre optic cables, including aerial, underground duct microduct, micromodule, FFTX, specialist, indoor products. The company was formerly known as Birla Ericsson Optical Limited and changed its name to Birla Cable Limited in September 2016. Birla Cable Limited was incorporated in 1992 and is based in Rewa, India.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Communication Equipment within the Technology industry.', 'Provides products and services in Communication Equipment within the Technology industry.', 'Technology; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Technology sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Technology.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('BIRLACORPN', 'Birla Corporation Limited (BIRLACORPN) is a company operating in the Basic Materials sector (Building Materials). Birla Corporation Limited manufactures and sells cement and clinker in India and internationally. It operates through three segments: Cement, Jute, and Others. The company offers ordinary Portland, Portland Pozzolana, and Portland slag cement under the MP Birla Cement Perfect Plus, MP Birla Cement Samrat Advanced, MP Birla Cement Ultimate Ultra, MP Birla Cement Unique, MP Birla Cement Samrat, MP Birla Cement Ultimate, MP Birla Cement Chetak, MP Birla Cement PSC, MP Birla Cement Multicem, and MP Birla Cement Concrecem brands used in bridges, dams, railway sleepers, reservoirs, industrial buildings, marine structures, cooling towers, metro lines, and airport runways. It also manufactures various jute products, such as jute yarn, floor and wall coverings, lino hessian, decorative fabrics, nursery cloths, scrims, jute carpets, non-woven jute felts, hydrocarbon-free bags/cloths, canvas, carpet backing cloths, which are used in mats, yarns, ropes, bags, carpets, and panama. In addition, It offers iron and steel castings. The company exports its products. The company was formerly known as Birla Jute Manufacturing Company Limited and changed its name to Birla Corporation Limited in 1998. Birla Corporation Limited was incorporated in 1919 and is based in Kolkata, India.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Building Materials within the Basic Materials industry.', 'Provides products and services in Building Materials within the Basic Materials industry.', 'Basic Materials; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Basic Materials sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Basic Materials.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('BIRLAMONEY', 'Aditya Birla Money Limited (BIRLAMONEY) is a company operating in the Financial Services sector (Capital Markets). Aditya Birla Money Limited provides financial services in India. The company operates through three segments: Broking, Wholesale Debt Market, and Others. It offers stock and commodity broking; portfolio management services; depository and e-insurance repository solutions; and various financial products, as well as research and investment advisory services. The company was formerly known as Apollo Sindhoori Capital Investments Ltd and changed its name to Aditya Birla Money Limited in August 2009. Aditya Birla Money Limited was incorporated in 1995 and is based in Chennai, India. The company operates as a subsidiary of Aditya Birla Capital Limited.

