INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('BIRLANU', 'BirlaNu Limited (BIRLANU) is a company operating in the Industrials sector (Building Products & Equipment). BirlaNu Limited, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and distributes home and building products and services in India, Europe, and internationally. The company operates through five segments: Roofs, Walls, Pipes and Construction Chemicals, Floors, and Others. It offers fiber cement, fortune fiber cement, ultracool fiber cement, and colored steel roofs, as well as leakproof sealing and structural support tools and accessories under the Charminar brand name; AAC blocks, panels, designer cement boards, and planks under the BirlaNu Aerocon brand name; and CPVC, uPVC, SWR, silent, UGD, foamcore, pressure, column, casing, PPR, HDPE, MDPE, gas pipes, electrofusion fittings, FHTC fittings, and water tanks under the BirlaNu Leakproof Pipes and Topline by BirlaNu Leakproof Pipes brand names. The company also provides wall putty and primer under the BirlaNu TruColour Putty and BirlaNu Primers brand names; bonding agents, waterproofing solutions, tile adhesives and grouts, epoxy and polyurethane coatings, anti-corrosion linings, and block joining mortars under the BirlaNu brand name; and laminates, engineered and resilient floorings, skirtings, and wall panels under the Parador brand name. In addition, it engages in wind power generation; and manufacturing of material handling and processing plant and equipment. The company was formerly known as HIL Limited and changed its name to BirlaNu Limited in March 2025. BirlaNu Limited was incorporated in 1946 and is based in New Delhi, India.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Building Products & Equipment within the Industrials industry.', 'Provides products and services in Building Products & Equipment within the Industrials industry.', 'Industrials; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Industrials sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Industrials.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('BIRLAPREC', 'Birla Precision Technologies Limited (BIRLAPREC) is a company operating in the Industrials sector (Tools & Accessories). Birla Precision Technologies Limited manufactures and sells machine tools and accessories, precision and automotive components, and castings in India, Japan, the United States, and internationally. It operates through Tooling, Automotive Components, and Other segments. The company offers tool holders, including collet, side lock, milling, shrink fit, dual taper, special, stub, extra gauge length, morse taper, turning tool, and mechanical holders; work and tool holding products; hydraulic and power grip milling chucks; production boosters; wooden box kits; boring bar adapters; jacobs tapers; drill chuck adapters; tapping systems; VDI shank tooling; reduction sleeves; shrink-fit heating machines; collets; and accessories. It also provides cutting tools comprising solid carbide drills, solid carbide end mills, twist and center drills, reamers, bore and shank type milling cutters, screwing taps, tools bits, engineering files, and grooving tools, as well as duratool products, consisting of hammer, masonry, and H series drills; annular cutters; carbide tip drills; steel files; ultra-thin and chopsaw wheels; depressed center discs; and TCT circular saws. In addition, the company offers ferrous shell casting products, such as bearing and turbine housings; braking; engine parts; fuel system shafts; o-ring carriers; drive shafts; end parts for metallic bellows; flanges; hydraulic spools; hydraulic actuator cylinders; rocker arm levers; halter; end yokes; crank shafts; fork selectors; machinery application; and turbocharger components for railways. It sells its products under the Dagger, Hathyar, Ninja, Panther and Carbomach brands. The company exports its products to Japan, Germany, the Czech Republic, Europe, and the Asia Pacific. The company was formerly known as Birla Kennametal Limited and changed its name to Birla Precision Technologies Limited in November 2007. Birla Precision Technologies Limited was founded in 1937 and is based in Mumbai, India.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Tools & Accessories within the Industrials industry.', 'Provides products and services in Tools & Accessories within the Industrials industry.', 'Industrials; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Industrials sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Industrials.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('BLACKBUCK', 'BlackBuck Limited (BLACKBUCK) is a company operating in the Technology sector (Software - Application). BlackBuck Limited, together with its subsidiaries, provides payments, telematics, loads marketplace, and vehicle financing services in India. It operates in two segments, Truck Operator Services and Lending Business. The company offers digital solutions, including BlackBuck FASTag, GPS, Loads, Fuel Cards, and FinServe. It also engages in the provision of loans for the purchase of commercial vehicles; and logistics services. The company was formerly known as Zinka Logistics Solutions Limited and changed its name to BlackBuck Limited in August 2025. BlackBuck Limited was incorporated in 2015 and is based in Bengaluru, India.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Software - Application within the Technology industry.', 'Provides products and services in Software - Application within the Technology industry.', 'Technology; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Technology sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Technology.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('BLACKROSE', 'Black Rose Industries Limited (BLACKROSE) is a company operating in the Basic Materials sector (Specialty Chemicals). Black Rose Industries Limited engages in the import, distribution, and export of specialty and performance chemicals in India and internationally. The company distributes a range of specialty chemicals comprising 8-hydroxyquinoline, alpha picoline, aniline, benzylamine, crude BHT, CTPI/PVI, diallylamine, diethanolamine, ethyl cyanoacetate, gamma picoline, homopiperazine, hydroquinone, meta-aminophenol, meta cresol, meta xylene, methacrylamide, monoethanolamine, n-methylpyrrolidine, neopentyl glycol, pentamethyldiethylenetriamine, purified isophthalic acid, pyridine, pyrrole, resorcinol, sulfolane, tetramethylethylenediamine, triethanolamine, and triallylamine, as well as n,n-diisopropylethylamine; and performance chemicals, such as anionic and cationic flocculants, cyanoacrylate adhesives, polymer additives, rubber chemicals, thermoplastic elastomers, epoxy hardeners, and salt tablets. It also manufactures specialty and performance chemicals; a range of organic coagulants, such as polyamine, polydadmac, de-coloring agents, and blends under the BRILTREAT brand; and polyacrylamide flocculants under the BRILFLOC brand for water and wastewater treatment. In addition, the company produces acrylamide liquids and acrylamide powders under the BRILMIDE brand; n-methylol acrylamide (NMA) under the BRILMER NMA brand; and fabrics and made ups for industrial applications. Further, it operates two windmills in Rajasthan and Gujarat. The company serves the agrochemicals, pharmaceuticals, dyestuffs, petrochemicals, perfumeries, polymers, textiles, rubber, ceramics, water treatment, specialty chemicals, and other industrial sectors. It exports its products to Japan, Korea, the United States, and China. The company was formerly known as Asia Fab Ltd and changed its name to Black Rose Industries Limited in September 2006. The company was incorporated in 1990 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India. Black Rose Industries Limited operates as a subsidiary of Wedgewood Holdings Ltd.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Specialty Chemicals within the Basic Materials industry.', 'Provides products and services in Specialty Chemicals within the Basic Materials industry.', 'Basic Materials; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Basic Materials sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Basic Materials.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('BLEL', 'Behari Lal Engineering Limited (BLEL) is a company operating in the Basic Materials sector (Steel). Behari Lal Engineering Limited engages in the manufacturing and trading of iron and steel products in India. The company manufactures metal rolls for rolling mills across various grades including alloy cast steel rolls, alloy steel base adamite rolls, graphitic steel rolls, S. G. Iron Pearlitic Rolls, S. G. Iron Bainitic/Accicular Rolls, alloyed indefinite chill rolls, and forged rolls used in rolling processes to produce finished steel products such as TMT rebar and structural steel. It also offers engineering castings in various grades for industries including steel, iron, mining and aggregate crushers, power, and sugar; carbon, alloy steel, tool steel, valve steel, and stainless steel bars in various sections such as rounds, round corner square, flats and hex, with different sizes; forging ingots and forged shafts/ blocks for application in industries, such as automotive, aerospace, oil & gas, energy, and heavy engineering. The company caters to industries such as automobile, steel, mining, infrastructure and construction, power, aerospace and defence, and cement. It sells its products in India, Afghanistan, Brazil, Finland, France, Germany, Ireland, Mexico, Nepal, Nigeria, South Africa, Tanzania, Togo, Uganda, UAE, and the USA. Behari Lal Engineering Limited was incorporated in 1995 and is based in Delhi, India.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Steel within the Basic Materials industry.', 'Provides products and services in Steel within the Basic Materials industry.', 'Basic Materials; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Basic Materials sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Basic Materials.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('BLIL', 'Balmer Lawrie Investments Limited (BLIL) is a company operating in the Industrials sector (Conglomerates). Balmer Lawrie Investments Limited engages in the non banking financial activities in India. It is involved in industrial packaging, logistic services and infrastructure, travel and vacation, greases and lubricants, chemicals, refinery and oil field, investment, and other businesses. The company was incorporated in 2001 and is based in Kolkata, India.

