INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('CPPLUS', 'Aditya Infotech Limited (CPPLUS) is a company operating in the Industrials sector (Building Products & Equipment). Aditya Infotech Limited manufactures, assembles and trades security and surveillance equipment in India and internationally. The company offers analog cameras, digital video recorders, internet protocol network cameras, network video recorders, access control products, mobile surveillance solutions, body-worn cameras, smart Wi-Fi cameras, digital door locks, video door phones and other surveillance-aligned products temperature screening solutions, interactive displays, routers, cables, power supplies, and thermal cameras. It also provides temperature screening solutions, explosion-proof cameras, integrated central command and control software, learning-based video analytics solutions, access control, time-attendance solutions, biometric products, wifi doorbells and video door-phones, HMS, AMS, interactive displays, monitors, SD Cards, as well as other accessories and products including cabling, racks, storage solutions and customized solutions; and products for enterprise and consumer segments under the CP PLUS and Dahua brands. In addition, it offers power over ethernet network switches, NVR/DVR racks, switched-mode power supply power supplies, and cables. Further, it provides cloud storage services for surveillance management under CP PLUS Cloud Storage brand name; and software solutions, such as health monitoring systems, attendance management systems, and video management software. It offers its products to government establishments, retail chains, financial institutions, residential, industrial warehouse, public spaces, and infrastructure projects. The company was formerly known as Perfect Lucky Goldstar International Limited and changed its name to Aditya Infotech Limited in August 1997. The company was founded in 1994 and is based in Noida, India.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Building Products & Equipment within the Industrials industry.', 'Provides products and services in Building Products & Equipment within the Industrials industry.', 'Industrials; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Industrials sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Industrials.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('CRAFTSMAN', 'Craftsman Automation Limited (CRAFTSMAN) is a company operating in the Consumer Cyclical sector (Auto Parts). Craftsman Automation Limited operates as an engineering company in India. It operates through Powertrain, Aluminium Products, and Industrial & Engineering segments. The Powertrain segment manufactures engine parts, including cylinder blocks and cylinder heads, camshafts, transmission parts, gear box housings, turbo charges, and bearing caps. The Aluminium Products segment offers crank case and cylinder blocks for two wheelers, and engine and structural parts for passenger vehicles; gear box housings for heavy commercial vehicle; and aluminium casting products for power transmission applications. The Industrial & Engineering segment provides stationary racking for warehouses, V-stores, roll form products, and automated storage and retrieval systems; and SPM and material handling products, gears and gear boxes, tool rooms, mould bases, and sheet metals. The company offers metal and metal products; electricals or electronic machinery, railway or tramway locomotives, rolling stock, railway or tramway fixtures and fittings, and mechanical appliances; machining services; trades in marine engines, and hoists and cranes; and cast-iron products for stationary engines. It serves commercial vehicles, special utility vehicles, tractors, off-highway vehicles, two-wheelers, passenger vehicles, power transmission and distribution, automotive, foundries, railways, textile and printing machines, industrial engineering, fast moving consumer goods, e-commerce, food and beverages, logistics, pharmaceuticals, and electronics sectors. The company also exports its products. Craftsman Automation Limited was incorporated in 1986 and is based in Coimbatore, India.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Auto Parts within the Consumer Cyclical industry.', 'Provides products and services in Auto Parts within the Consumer Cyclical industry.', 'Consumer Cyclical; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Consumer Cyclical sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Consumer Cyclical.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
