INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('DEEDEV', 'DEE Development Engineers Limited (DEEDEV) is a company operating in the Industrials sector (Metal Fabrication). DEE Development Engineers Limited manufactures and sells prefabricated engineering products, pipe fittings, and piping systems in India and internationally. It operates in three segments: Piping, Power, and Heavy Fabrication. The company offers pressure piping systems, piping spools, induction pipe bends, longitudinally submerged arc welding pipes, industrial pipe fittings, pressure vessels, industrial stacks, and modular skids, as well as boiler superheater coils, de-super heaters, and other customized manufactured components. It also provides engineering services comprising support, pre-bid, basic, layout, material, detailed, and pipe support engineering, as well as power and process piping, modular skid and shop fabricated piping, stress analysis, and Indian boiler regulations; and wind turbine towers. In addition, the company generates biomass-based power. It serves the thermal and nuclear power, oil and gas, petrochemical and refinery, subsea, marine and offshore, process, desalination plant, cement, and other industries. DEE Development Engineers Limited was incorporated in 1988 and is headquartered in Faridabad, India.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Metal Fabrication within the Industrials industry.', 'Provides products and services in Metal Fabrication within the Industrials industry.', 'Industrials; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Industrials sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Industrials.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('DEEP', 'Deep Polymers Limited (DEEP) is a company operating in the Basic Materials sector (Specialty Chemicals). Deep Polymers Limited manufactures and sells filler masterbatches in India. The company offers white, black, color, and UV, as well as additive masterbatches, including antiblock, antifog, antimicrobial/bactiblock additive, antioxidant, antirodent, antistatic, desiccant, flame retardant, nucleating and clarifying agent, optical brightener, oxo biodegradable, PPA, and slip masterbatches. It also provides antifab fillers, such as calcium filler PP/PE, calcium filler PP/PE  lamination, super brightener filler, coloured tinge filler, natural filler  TPFN 001, and process modifier. In addition, the company offers non-woven, PP multifilament, and biodegradable master batches. Its products are used in HDPE; PP; LDPE; LLDPE; FBLK007- black tone; PPCP; PS; HIPS; blown film/cast film/mono layer/multi layer; pipes; automotive compound PE/PP/glass filled; engineering compound PC/ABS/nylon; antifab filler PP/PE; ABS; SAN; PP/PE tape extrusion; PP/PE lamination; PP/PE injection and blow moulding; PP box strapping; PP/PE calendaring process; PET optical fiber; PET bottle; polyester sheet; and engineering masterbatch PC/ABS/PBT/nylon/PET applications. The company was founded in 1992 and is based in Gandhinagar, India.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Specialty Chemicals within the Basic Materials industry.', 'Provides products and services in Specialty Chemicals within the Basic Materials industry.', 'Basic Materials; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Basic Materials sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Basic Materials.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('DEEPAKFERT', 'Deepak Fertilisers And Petrochemicals Corporation Limited (DEEPAKFERT) is a company operating in the Basic Materials sector (Chemicals). Deepak Fertilisers And Petrochemicals Corporation Limited engages in the manufacture, trade, and sale of bulk chemicals in India. It operates through the Chemicals, Fertilisers, and Realty segments. The company offers chemicals, including ammonia, methanol, dilute and concentrated nitric acid, carbon dioxide, iso-propyl alcohol, propane, and bulk and speciality chemicals; and fertilisers, such as nitro phosphate, mutriate of potash, diammonium phosphate ap, ammonium sulphate, mixtures, single super phosphate, sulphur, micronutrients, SSF, and bio fertilisers. It also provides pharmacopeia solvents under the PUROSOLV name; food-grade liquid carbon dioxide and solar-grade nitric acid; stainless-steel pickling solutions under the PICKBRITE name; hygiene and disinfectant chemicals under the Cororid and PuroGuard+ names; technical ammonium nitrate products, such as low-density porous prill, high-density uncoated prill, and medical-grade uncoated prill ammonium nitrate products, as well as ammonium nitrate solutions; and NPK, specialty, and water-soluble fertilizers under the Mahadhan brand. In addition, the company provides petroleum; consultancy to mining companies; and value-added blasting services to mining and explosives industries. Further, it engages in the value-added real estate and agriculture produce businesses; storage and handling of technical ammonium nitrate; purchase and sale of commodities; gas trading; brand management; online sale of products; leasing of furniture and home improvement products; development of an e-commerce platform; and construction and operations of design centers, shopping malls, complexes, and retail outlets, as well as other allied activities. Deepak Fertilisers And Petrochemicals Corporation Limited was incorporated in 1979 and is based in Pune, India.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Chemicals within the Basic Materials industry.', 'Provides products and services in Chemicals within the Basic Materials industry.', 'Basic Materials; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Basic Materials sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Basic Materials.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('DEEPAKNTR', 'Deepak Nitrite Limited (DEEPAKNTR) is a company operating in the Basic Materials sector (Chemicals). Deepak Nitrite Limited manufactures, trades, and sells chemical intermediates in India and internationally. It operates through Advanced Intermediates and Phenolics segments. The company offers sodium nitrite, sodium nitrate, nitro toluidines, fuel additives, nitrosylsulfuric acid, xylidines, oximes, cumidines, speciality agrochemicals, optical brighteners, nitric acid, fluorinated compounds, DASDA, benzotrifluoride, cumene, phenol, acetone, isopropyl alcohol, and alpha methyl styrene. It also provides 2 MePPDA, 2,3-xylidine, 2,4-xylidine, 2,6-xylidine, 2-ethylhexyl nitrate, 3-NOX, 4-NOX; 2B, 4BBT, ABP, ABP X, and BMK deepwhite powders; 2BL, ABP, AS, BA, BHT HC, DSP, MST, SPF Z, SI, UBR, UP, and XBE deepwhite liquids; 4BB conc, 4BB conc T, DMA-X, DMA-X conc, and UFD slurry deepwhite products; IPA, MAHCL, mHBTF, MMDPA, MNT(3- nitrotoluene), MT(m-toluidine), ONT(2- nitrotoluene), OT(o-toluidine), PNT(4- nitrotoluene), and PT(p-toluidine); B+ (brown colour), FX (yellow colour), and GLP (yellow colour) protecto products; ortho and para cumidines; and TFMAP, as well as project management consultancy services and manufactures polycarbonate compounds. The company serves colourants, dyes, rubber, paper, agrochemicals, pharmaceuticals, personal care, water treatment, glass, explosives, textiles, laminate and plywood, automotive, construction, adhesives, and sanitisers industries. Deepak Nitrite Limited was incorporated in 1970 and is headquartered in Vadodara, India.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Chemicals within the Basic Materials industry.', 'Provides products and services in Chemicals within the Basic Materials industry.', 'Basic Materials; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Basic Materials sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Basic Materials.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('DEN', 'DEN Networks Limited (DEN) is a company operating in the Communication Services sector (Entertainment). DEN Networks Limited, a media and entertainment company, engages in the distribution of television channels to households through a digital cable distribution network in India. The company operates through two segments: Cable and Broadband. It distributes and promotes television channels; supplies set-top boxes and related equipment; and provides visual entertainment through cable TV, over-the-top entertainment, and broadband services, as well as offers internet services. The company was incorporated in 2007 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.

