INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('DGCONTENT', 'Digicontent Limited (DGCONTENT) is a company operating in the Communication Services sector (Internet Content & Information). Digicontent Limited operates as a digital media and content solutions company in India. The company offers digital news ecosystem, such as hindustantimes.com, livemint.com, and livehindustan.com that covers news, business, politics, lifestyle, entertainment, and current affairs. It also operates platforms, including HT Auto, HT Tech, Healthshots, and Mint Money that provides content across automobiles, technology, health and wellness, and financial market products. In addition, the company offers source for movie reviews and ratings website through www.desimartini.com; and photo library. It is also involved in the aggregation and creation of audio and multi-screen videos; distribution of in-house creative and niche celeb-based content to mobile and digital users; and operates an audio feed that plays music inside across various stores. In addition, the company engages in the dissemination of news, knowledge, information, entertainment, and content of general interest in English, Hindi, and any other language through various digital and economic media; and management of advertising time and space on its news websites. The company was formerly known as HT Digital Ventures Limited and changed its name to Digicontent Limited in October 2017. Digicontent Limited was incorporated in 2017 and is based in New Delhi, India.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Internet Content & Information within the Communication Services industry.', 'Provides products and services in Internet Content & Information within the Communication Services industry.', 'Communication Services; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Communication Services sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Communication Services.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('DHABRIYA', 'Dhabriya Polywood Limited (DHABRIYA) is a company operating in the Industrials sector (Building Products & Equipment). Dhabriya Polywood Limited engages in the manufacture and supply of poly vinyl chloride (PVC) and unplasticized poly vinyl chloride (uPVC) products in India. The company operates in two segments, Plastic Product and Modular Furniture. It offers uPVC windows and doors system, aluminum windows and doors; PVC doors, wall panel, fencing, furniture, and foam board; SPC flooring; wall and ceiling fluted panels; plywood soffit ceiling and wall system panels; aluminum windows and doors; and extruded PVC profile sections and sheets, as well as moldings for various furnishing and furniture applications. It also provides modular furniture products. The company sells its products under the Polywood, Dynasty, and D-Stona, as well as Everluxe and Studio Arezzo brands. It exports its products. Dhabriya Polywood Limited was incorporated in 1992 and is headquartered in Jaipur, India.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Building Products & Equipment within the Industrials industry.', 'Provides products and services in Building Products & Equipment within the Industrials industry.', 'Industrials; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Industrials sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Industrials.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('DHAMPURSUG', 'Dhampur Sugar Mills Limited (DHAMPURSUG) is a company operating in the Consumer Defensive sector (Confectioners). Dhampur Sugar Mills Limited, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and sells sugar and its byproducts in India. It operates in six segments: Sugar, Chemicals, Ethanol, Potable Spirits, Power, and Other. The company offers branded, white, and raw sugar; ethyl acetate; RS, ethanol, extra-neutral alcohol (ENA), and industrial alcohol; and country liquor. It also engages in the sale of petrol and agricultural products; and co-generation and sale of power using bagasse and molasses. In addition, the company operates co-generation facilities with a capacity of 108.50 megawatts. It serves the power, distillery, and chemical sectors; institutional clients, domestic wholesalers, retail consumers, and food and beverage businesses; oil marketing companies; end users and traders; country liquor manufacturers; and distributors. Dhampur Sugar Mills Limited was incorporated in 1933 and is based in New Delhi, India.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Confectioners within the Consumer Defensive industry.', 'Provides products and services in Confectioners within the Consumer Defensive industry.', 'Consumer Defensive; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Consumer Defensive sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Consumer Defensive.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('DHANBANK', 'Dhanlaxmi Bank Limited (DHANBANK) is a company operating in the Financial Services sector (Banks - Regional). Dhanlaxmi Bank Limited provides various banking and financial services in India. The company operates through Treasury Operations, Corporate/Wholesale Banking, Retail Banking, and Other Banking Business Operations segments. It offers deposit products, such as savings and current accounts, and term deposits; loans, including personal, home, new and used car, two wheeler, commercial, gold, education, business, and green loans, as well as loans against securities and properties, and lease rental discounting; and foreign exchange services comprising foreign currency cash, cheque deposits, foreign currency demand drafts, and remittances. The company also provides export and import services; credit products comprising industrial and trade advance, import export assistance, and agricultural assistance; corporate salary; credit treasury bills and linked loans; trade finance, electronic bank guarantees, and liberalized remittance schemes; 3 in 1 trading accounts; and mutual funds investment services, as well as life, health, and car insurance products. In addition, it offers non-resident Indians (NRI) banking services, such as non-residential external accounts, non-resident ordinary accounts, recurring and term deposits, foreign currency non-resident fixed deposits, and resident foreign currency, as well as money transfer services and NRI property loans; and micro and agricultural banking, and financial planning services. Further, the company provides SME banking services, including working capital facilities, trade facilities, and capacity expansion services; credit, debit, and gift cards; retail and corporate net, mobile phone, and SMS banking; online services, such as bill payment, unified payments interface, prepaid mobile/DTH/data card recharges, missed call, shopping, positive pay, online trading, and custom duty online payments; and depository services, as well as safe deposit lockers. Dhanlaxmi Bank Limited was incorporated in 1927 and is based in Thrissur, India.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Banks - Regional within the Financial Services industry.', 'Provides products and services in Banks - Regional within the Financial Services industry.', 'Financial Services; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Financial Services sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Financial Services.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
