INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('FORTIS', 'Fortis Healthcare Limited (FORTIS) is a company operating in the Healthcare sector (Medical Care Facilities). Fortis Healthcare Limited operates as a healthcare delivery service provider in India. The company services in the areas of cardiac science, nephrology, diabetology/endocrinology, foetal medicine, infectious diseases, mental health and behavioral science, oncology, orthopedics, physiotherapy and rehabilitation, rheumatology, urology, nuclear medicine, critical care, emergency and trauma, general surgery, internal medicine, neurointerventional radiology, obstetrics and gynaecology, pediatrics, pediatrics, vascular surgery, and support facilities. It also provides services in the areas of infertility medicine, dental science, endocrine surgery, geriatric medicine, liver transplant and hepatobiliary sciences, neurology, ophthalmology, pain and palliative medicine, pulmonology, thoracic surgery, gastroenterology sciences, dermatology, ENT, haematology, medical generics, neurology, organ transplant, radiology, and transfusion medicines. In addition, the company offers various spectrum integrated healthcare services ranging from clinics to quaternary care facilities and a range of ancillary services, as well as secondary, and tertiary care services. The company''s healthcare verticals comprise hospitals, diagnostics, and day care specialty facilities. Fortis Healthcare Limited was incorporated in 1996 and is based in Gurugram, India.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Medical Care Facilities within the Healthcare industry.', 'Provides products and services in Medical Care Facilities within the Healthcare industry.', 'Healthcare; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Healthcare sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Healthcare.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('FOSECOIND', 'Foseco India Limited (FOSECOIND) is a company operating in the Basic Materials sector (Chemicals). Foseco India Limited engages in manufacturing of additives and consumables for the metallurgical industry in India and internationally. It offers feeder sleeves and risers, coatings for sand molds and cores, filters and gating systems, metal treatment for nonferrous alloys, crucibles and retorts, binders and molding materials, and ferrous metal treatment, as well as melt shop refractories and flow control and die coatings for permanent mold die casting. The company also provides foundry services, such as advice, practice magazines, white papers, training and support, and technical services, including analytical services and casting simulation support. It primarily serves the requirements of ferrous and non-ferrous foundries to automotive, tractors, M&HCV, 2 wheelers, general engineering, valves and pumps, power, railways and marine, construction, and mining equipment. The company was founded in 1932 and is based in Pune, India. Foseco India Limited operates as a subsidiary of Vesuvius plc.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Chemicals within the Basic Materials industry.', 'Provides products and services in Chemicals within the Basic Materials industry.', 'Basic Materials; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Basic Materials sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Basic Materials.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('FRACTAL', 'Fractal Analytics Limited (FRACTAL) is a company operating in the Technology sector (Software - Infrastructure). Fractal Analytics Limited provides artificial intelligence (AI) and analytics solutions to automate business workflows, extract insights from data, and optimize enterprise operations. The company offers agentic products for enterprises, including Cogentiq platform, Cogentiq CX, Cogentiq E-commerce, Cogentiq Innovation, Cogentiq invoice to cash, Cogentiq underwriting for financial services, and Cogentiq underwriting for insurances; Al health assistant; Text to image generator; and Al powered executive coach. It also provides Al for medical imaging, and revenue growth; Al foundational solutions, such as data operations, enterprise migration, software delivery, enterprise outcomes, campaign optimization, data science, custom LLMs, network operations, and process automation; and Al business solutions comprising reconciliation assist, trade ops assist, sales assist, procure assist, consumer insights platform, catalyst for growth, route to market digital sales platform, better business decisions, ai skilling solutions, edtech, and gen-ai-powered recruiting platform. In addition, the company is involved in generative AI, computer vision, machine learning operations, cognitive automation, conversational AI, and quantum computing; and finance analytics; and supply chain, ESG (environmental, social, governance), finance analytics, and integrated marketing effectiveness (IME) activities. The company serves consumer packaged goods, retail, technology media and telecom, healthcare and life sciences, financial services, insurance, industrials manufacturing and energy. The company was incorporated in 2000 and is based in Mumbai, India.

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Software - Infrastructure within the Technology industry.', 'Provides products and services in Software - Infrastructure within the Technology industry.', 'Technology; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Technology sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Technology.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('FREDUN', 'Fredun Pharmaceuticals Limited (FREDUN) is a company operating in the Healthcare sector (Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic). Fredun Pharmaceuticals Limited manufactures and sells pharmaceutical formulations, dietary/herbal supplements, nutraceuticals, animal healthcare products, cosmeceuticals, mobility and rehabilitation products, and other healthcare products in India, Africa, Southeast Asia, Commonwealth of Independent States countries, MENA region, and Latin America. The company offers allopathic formulations, including analgesics/NSAID, antacid/antiulcer, anthelmintic, antibacterial, anti-diabetic, anti-inflammatory, anti-malarial, anti-obesity, antacid, anthelmintic, anticoagulants, anticonvulsants, antidiarrhoeal, antidepressant, antifungal, antihistamines/antiallergic, antihypertensives, antiviral, bone modulating drugs, bronchodilators and anti-asthma drugs, calcium tablets, cardiovascular, diuretic, impotence drugs, laxative, and appetite stimulant with multivitamins. It also provides surgical products, such as IV fluids and cannulas, disposable syringes, infusion sets, surgical gloves and cottons, and personal healthcare products; APIs; direct compressible granules; pellets; animal healthcare products; aqua products; and niche products. Additionally, the company offers therapeutic products under the brand Hormone Range Products, a specialty therapeutics brand focused on longevity, hormone health, recovery science, and human performance solutions. Fredun Pharmaceuticals Limited was incorporated in 1987 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.,

Products & Services: Provides products and services in Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic within the Healthcare industry.', 'Provides products and services in Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic within the Healthcare industry.', 'Healthcare; Miscellaneous', 'Growth in Healthcare sector demand, market share expansion, and Operational Efficiency.', 'Raw material price volatility, sector regulation changes, and macroeconomic competition in Healthcare.', 0, NULL, '2026-09-12 18:36:04.283986+05:30', '2026-09-12 19:18:17.458118+05:30');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO opportunities_risk ("ticker", "about_company", "product_services", "sectors", "opportunities", "risk", "is_multibagger", "additional_note", "created_at", "updated_at") VALUES ('FRONTSP', 'Frontier Springs Limited (FRONTSP) is a company operating in the Industrials sector (Metal Fabrication). Frontier Springs Limited engages in the production and sale of L.H.B. springs, hot coiled compression springs, air springs, and forging items in India. Its forging products include anti-roll bar assemblies, screw couplings, draft gear assemblies, hangers, knuckle throwers, top followers, wedge, and brake blocks. The company also offers air spring suspension systems. It serves railways, wagons, locomotives, carriages, coaches, heavy engineering industries, and original earth mover equipment manufacturers. Frontier Springs Limited was incorporated in 1981 and is based in Kanpur, India.

